  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/wordmarks/outlined/cracked/f64_wordmark.png\" alt=\"Faithful 64x\">\n<h1 style=\"font-weight:900\"><br>Minecraft的首选64x资源包。</h1>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/addons/faithful-64x-bedrock\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/bedrock_button.png\" alt=\"在此获取基岩版资源包\"> </a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<hr>\n<p>Minecraft纹理升级的逻辑下一步。就像 Faithful 32x 一样，这个资源包基于原版艺术风格——以四倍分辨率完美重制，并添加了恰到好处的额外细节，带来完美的原版风格 Minecraft 体验。<br><br>通过直接基于其32x版本的对应纹理，它实现了资源包之间的高度一致性，并且质量不断提升。如果你喜欢细节丰富的资源包，但仍想保持原版的感觉，那么这个资源包就是为你准备的！</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/discord_button.png\" alt=\"Discord服务器\"></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/website_button.png\" alt=\"网站\"></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">附加信息：</h1>\n<p>如果您有任何反馈、想要报告错误或需要帮助，请加入上面的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 服务器，创建 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Faithful-64x-Java/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Issue</a>，或在下方评论。对于任何商业或分发相关的问题，请参阅我们的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252flicense\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">许可证</a>。<br><br>所有纹理和附加组件均由志愿者在空闲时间提供。任何人都可以通过上面链接的 Discord 服务器提交纹理，或制作 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252faddons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">附加组件</a> 以在我们的网站上正式列出。在开始之前，请阅读我们的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.faithfulpack.net%252fpages%252ftextures%252ff64-texturing-guidelines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">纹理指南</a>，其中详细概述了该资源包的艺术风格。<br><br>每个资源包都在我们的 <a href=\"faithfulpack.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">网站</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/faithful_resource_pack/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252ffaithful_resource_pack%252fsubmissions%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFaithful-Resource-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 上有列表，部分资源包还额外列在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcpedl.com%252fuser%252ffaithful-resource-pack%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCPEDL</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/Faithful_Resource_Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forums</a> 上。**从任何其他站点下载的都是非官方、不受支持且可能存在危险的！** 请记住在网上保持安全。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">我们的其他项目：</h1>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/faithful-32x\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/f32_button.png\" alt=\"Faithful 32x\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-pa\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-pa\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32_button.png\" alt=\"Classic Faithful 32x\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-jappa\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-jappa\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32j_button.png\" alt=\"Classic Faithful 32x Jappa\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf64j_button.png\" alt=\"Classic Faithful 64x Jappa\"></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<hr>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:smaller\">Faithful 是一个开源且由社区驱动的 Minecraft 资源包合集，旨在提供比默认 Minecraft 纹理更高分辨率的版本，同时忠于原作。</div>",
